            {
                "entry_id": "664eccf5-6dcf-39ae-a1df-6e23392ad716",
                "word": "Maga",
                "pos": "phrase",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "eeeea14c-6d35-3a01-a6ee-738bfc5715fd",
                        "entry_id": "664eccf5-6dcf-39ae-a1df-6e23392ad716",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative letter-case form of MAGA (“Make America Great Again”)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "UK",
                            "alt-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bdb09209-c131-4c76-a76a-247f2208653c",
                                "sense_id": "eeeea14c-6d35-3a01-a6ee-738bfc5715fd",
                                "text": "The 17-year-old told a CBS affiliate the Maga hats - a staple of President Trump's campaign - are a \"racist and hateful symbol.\" ¶ According to the sheriff's office, the student began verbally attacking her peer on Monday because of the Maga hat, before grabbing and hurling it to the ground."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c427bc6-7a22-49ba-bcf5-1b94765c33c9",
                                "sense_id": "eeeea14c-6d35-3a01-a6ee-738bfc5715fd",
                                "text": "The millions that Willis says he stands to make from a Maga-endorsed YMCA presumably makes it easier for him and his associates to put on all the bells and whistles (well, fringe and leather) for an administration set on a scorched-earth approach to LGBTQ+ protections."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "647fe93e-be97-4176-8eaa-4bf7c7fd1029",
                                "sense_id": "eeeea14c-6d35-3a01-a6ee-738bfc5715fd",
                                "text": "For those used to her softer sensibilities, Taylor's current lifestyle is giving Maga energy. It's brazen, proud and 10-carat garish. It's Ralph Lauren and USA."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "89d1a111-ea1c-393e-a132-0cac4e0e1d06",
                "word": "MAGA",
                "pos": "phrase",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "eb1b1994-05d8-3211-afbc-12d26d00918b",
                        "entry_id": "89d1a111-ea1c-393e-a132-0cac4e0e1d06",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Acronym of Make America Great Again."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "US",
                            "abbreviation",
                            "acronym",
                            "alt-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d09cbf1-8cf7-492a-aba5-b9404c2deec6",
                                "sense_id": "eb1b1994-05d8-3211-afbc-12d26d00918b",
                                "text": "The 17-year-old told a CBS affiliate the Maga hats - a staple of President Trump's campaign - are a \"racist and hateful symbol.\" ¶ According to the sheriff's office, the student began verbally attacking her peer on Monday because of the Maga hat, before grabbing and hurling it to the ground."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "edbbab4d-11bb-4bad-8538-dd7ce59ac871",
                                "sense_id": "eb1b1994-05d8-3211-afbc-12d26d00918b",
                                "text": "“Four more years!” the incumbent’s backers called out even louder, largely unencumbered by face coverings. ¶ “Black Lives Matter!” ¶ “Black Lives MAGA!”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "74fe5ea6-1b45-43a1-bf79-80410984ab7a",
                                "sense_id": "eb1b1994-05d8-3211-afbc-12d26d00918b",
                                "text": "“Mitch knows he can’t take Trump off the table there,” Scott Reed, a longtime G.O.P. strategist, said of the calculations of Mitch McConnell, the Senate majority leader. “He needs him to energize the MAGA crowd.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
