                            {
                                "example_id": "b01a67a3-c9e1-4bae-a1f4-c4d8dc25833c",
                                "sense_id": "16a6cd53-5fdf-3b17-a88f-8dd60536a318",
                                "text": "MAGA Republicans",
                                "translation": "川普主義共和黨人"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "01ecdae9-c12f-3470-a43c-fd7a5ae5084b",
                "word": "MAGA",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "ca00bc6a-4583-4a7a-a19d-c7eb6c34e29b",
                        "entry_id": "01ecdae9-c12f-3470-a43c-fd7a5ae5084b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "MAGAs"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8d83cea8-8ec7-3064-a18f-d1d4c97880fe",
                        "entry_id": "01ecdae9-c12f-3470-a43c-fd7a5ae5084b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "唐納·川普政治哲學的追隨者。"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "美國政治"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1c2a4101-ebb1-452a-b86a-ae15dd3630a0",
                                "sense_id": "8d83cea8-8ec7-3064-a18f-d1d4c97880fe",
                                "text": "A terrified mob of these MAGAs in their red hats had gathered in the town square screaming: “Where’s Sarah? Where’s Sarah? She promised to make Stars Hollow great again! She’s the only one who can save us!”",
                                "translation": "一群戴著紅帽子的川普政治哲學的支持者聚集在鎮廣場，驚恐萬分，尖叫著：“莎拉在哪裡？莎拉在哪裡？她承諾要讓星空谷再次偉大！只有她能救我們！”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d6c50bf3-76a2-436d-9f61-c8ce1331516a",
                                "sense_id": "8d83cea8-8ec7-3064-a18f-d1d4c97880fe",
                                "text": "A different study by political scientists found that Trump’s anti-immigrant ravings actually inspired more white people to vote against him than it did white MAGAs to vote for him.",
                                "translation": "政治學家進行的另一項研究發現，川普的反移民言論實際上激發了更多白人投票反對他，而不是更多白人川普政治哲學追隨者支持他。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d420f267-1c50-4d52-95f7-efff06076675",
                                "sense_id": "8d83cea8-8ec7-3064-a18f-d1d4c97880fe",
                                "text": "Trump, a man devoted to television like it’s religion, likely couldn’t give a damn, but the RNC, the state parties, and the various victory committees will be working their asses off to deploy MAGAs into the field.",
                                "translation": "川普對電視的熱愛如同宗教般虔誠，他可能對此毫不在意，但共和黨全國委員會、各州政黨以及各個勝利委員會將不遺餘力地將川普政治哲學運動部署到電視領域。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a87999c7-1267-4063-a693-2c65af22cbcd",
                                "sense_id": "8d83cea8-8ec7-3064-a18f-d1d4c97880fe",
                                "text": "There were two problems for an African American in Washington DC, during a MAGA rally. First, there were too many pro-Trump MAGAs in town. Worse, there were lots of police officers too. […] At Harry’s Bar a few blocks from the hotel, Money B had apparently made friends because these MAGAs turned out to be fans of his famous songs, like “The Humpty Dance.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "98309d57-2d13-4a14-8098-81f7e8a450d0",
                                "sense_id": "8d83cea8-8ec7-3064-a18f-d1d4c97880fe",
                                "text": "Many of the founders and leaders of today’s populist parties now just aren’t like their followers. The followers either don’t know – there are plenty of vox pops where Magas (Make American Great Agains) still describe Trump as a self-made man – or don’t care: all this fussing about class origins and elite linkages is just what bitter, twisted liberals do."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b6ffa78-c140-4c26-8dd5-f16662e44aec",
                                "sense_id": "8d83cea8-8ec7-3064-a18f-d1d4c97880fe",
                                "text": "MY LIBERAL RUSSIAN FRIENDS STARTED TO CALL THOSE PEOPLE KRYM-NASHI (“CRIMEA’S OURS”-NIKS) MUCH AS AMERICAN LIBERALS CALL DONALD TRUMP’S FANS MAGAS."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "770a8eca-6a96-46d0-95b1-c3957c02f0e4",
                                "sense_id": "8d83cea8-8ec7-3064-a18f-d1d4c97880fe",
                                "text": "For DeSantis, it’s “Ron De-sanctimonious.” It doesn’t matter whether his MAGAs know what sanctimonious means; Trump makes the point and his loyal servants get a good laugh."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ec7e29d7-edad-45e2-90a0-5619d3b7addf",
                                "sense_id": "8d83cea8-8ec7-3064-a18f-d1d4c97880fe",
                                "text": "Taylor tweeted about the bind that Zelenskyy found himself in: “Ukraine, of course, is desperate for US support. The biggest risk they face is falling out of favor with the American public. And that explains any upcoming recapitulation of ‘no pressure.’ They can’t afford to piss off the MAGAs. They are truly hostages in this.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "86fb8da2-f236-42ba-b576-3c9fbe329916",
                                "sense_id": "8d83cea8-8ec7-3064-a18f-d1d4c97880fe",
                                "text": "In this pop-culture milieu, political parties are like personality cults, and their leaders are symbolic of their group’s identity. So in addition to Janeites (fans of Jane Austen), Beliebers (Justin Bieber) and Swifties (Taylor Swift), we now have MAGAs (Donald Trump), Corbynistas (Jeremy Corbyn) and Boristas (Boris Johnson)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "60791410-cf81-46be-a45f-ce65dc5a376e",
                                "sense_id": "8d83cea8-8ec7-3064-a18f-d1d4c97880fe",
                                "text": "I am sure he reasoned that as an Independent all he would have accomplished would be the sure election of Hillary by splitting MAGAs and Republicans, as Teddy Roosevelt did when he tried to regain the Presidency."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "11f6b5e9-05ca-4613-ba48-0977ad01f947",
                                "sense_id": "8d83cea8-8ec7-3064-a18f-d1d4c97880fe",
                                "text": "The adults were to blame, not just the crazy MAGAs but ordinary people who don’t know any better."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "82b6cd1e-9e5b-3946-bee8-84a27f3b9d1a",
                "word": "MAGA",
                "pos": "phrase",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "daa3b749-fe94-375d-b41f-594aba8cd6be",
                        "entry_id": "82b6cd1e-9e5b-3946-bee8-84a27f3b9d1a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Make America Great Again (“讓美國再次偉大”) 之首字母縮拼詞"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "054e7583-0927-4c77-be5d-3a9a2de81383",
                                "sense_id": "daa3b749-fe94-375d-b41f-594aba8cd6be",
                                "text": "The 17-year-old told a CBS affiliate the Maga hats - a staple of President Trump's campaign - are a \"racist and hateful symbol.\" ¶ According to the sheriff's office, the student began verbally attacking her peer on Monday because of the Maga hat, before grabbing and hurling it to the ground.",
                                "translation": "這名 17 歲的少年告訴哥倫比亞廣播公司 (CBS) 的附屬機構，讓美國再次偉大帽子（川普總統競選活動的主要標誌）是「種族主義和仇恨的象徵」。 ¶ 據治安官辦公室稱，這名學生週一開始因為那頂 Maga 帽子而對她的同學進行言語攻擊，然後抓住帽子並將其扔到地上。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5ac0194d-b744-4b6c-a833-82b1b67d8899",
                                "sense_id": "daa3b749-fe94-375d-b41f-594aba8cd6be",
                                "text": "“Four more years!” the incumbent’s backers called out even louder, largely unencumbered by face coverings. ¶ “Black Lives Matter!” ¶ “Black Lives MAGA!”",
                                "translation": "「再來四年！」現任總統的支持者們呼喊得更大聲，基本上不受面罩的影響。 ¶ “黑人的命也是命！” ¶ “黑人的命讓美國再次偉大！”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c251a46-de5a-4d78-b4dd-0f1b30f04833",
                                "sense_id": "daa3b749-fe94-375d-b41f-594aba8cd6be",
                                "text": "“Mitch knows he can’t take Trump off the table there,” Scott Reed, a longtime G.O.P. strategist, said of the calculations of Mitch McConnell, the Senate majority leader. “He needs him to energize the MAGA crowd.”",
                                "translation": "「米奇知道他無法阻止川普，」共和黨資深議員斯科特·里德說。戰略家談到參議院多數黨領袖米奇·麥康奈爾的算計時說。“他需要他來激勵‘讓美國再次偉大’（MAGA）人群。”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ]
    }
}